{# BJJ Position Top (Attacks) Page Template #}
{# Generates offensive perspective pages from top section #}
{# Input: top (full top section from JSON) #}

---
title: "{{ top.name }} | BJJ Position Guide | BJJ Graph"
description: "{{ top.description }}"
---

{# PostHog A/B Testing Metadata #}
<body data-content-type="positions" data-sections='["state-properties","overview","state-invariants","prerequisites","key-principles","offensive-transitions","defensive-responses","counter-transitions","decision-tree","common-errors","training-drills","optimal-submission-paths","position-metrics","expert-insights","related-content"]'>

<!-- Schema Markup - HowTo for Attacks -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Attack from {{ top.name }}",
  "description": "Step-by-step guide to attacking and submitting from {{ top.name.replace(' Top', '').replace(' (Attacks)', '') }} position in BJJ.",
  "step": [
    {%- for transition in top.offensive_transitions[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Execute {{ transition.technique }}",
      "text": "From this position, execute {{ transition.technique }} to transition to {{ transition.target_position }}. Success rate for advanced practitioners: {{ transition.success_rates.advanced }}%.",
      "position": {{ loop.index }}
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ],
  "totalTime": "PT2M"
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - FAQ from Common Errors -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for error in top.common_errors[:5] %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What happens if you {{ error.error.lower() }}?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{{ error.consequence }} The correct approach is: {{ error.correction }}"
      }
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - WebPage -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "{{ top.name }}",
  "description": "{{ top.description }}",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "BJJ Graph",
    "url": "https://bjjgraph.org"
  }
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - Breadcrumbs -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Positions",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Positions/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 3,
      "name": "{{ top.name }}",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Positions/{{ top.name.replace(' ', '-') }}"
    }
  ]
}
</script>

{# Debug mode indicator #}
{% if debug_mode %}
<!--
  🐛 BJJ Graph A/B Testing Debug Mode (Top Perspective)

  Content Type: positions
  Section Count: 15
  Week Seed: {{ week_seed }}
  Visual Variant: {{ visual_elements }}

  Generated: {{ generation_timestamp }}
-->
{% endif %}

# {{ top.name }}

{% for tag in top.tags %}#{{ tag }} {% endfor %}

> **Attack Focus**: This page covers offensive strategies, attacks, and submission opportunities from the top player's perspective.
>
> **Quick Stats**: Advanced practitioners maintain control {{ top.position_metrics.retention_rate.advanced }}% of the time and finish submissions in {{ top.position_metrics.submission_probability.advanced }}% of exchanges.

---

{# Flexbox wrapper for A/B testing #}
<main class="content-wrapper" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

<section id="state-properties" class="content-section">

## Position Properties

- **State ID**: `{{ top.state_id }}`
- **Point Value**: {{ top.state_properties.point_value }} ({% if top.state_properties.point_value == 4 %}Dominant position{% elif top.state_properties.point_value == 3 %}Guard pass{% elif top.state_properties.point_value == 2 %}Advantage{% else %}{{ top.state_properties.point_value }} points{% endif %})
- **Position Type**: {{ top.state_properties.position_type }}
- **Risk Level**: {{ top.state_properties.risk_level }}
- **Energy Cost**: {{ top.state_properties.energy_cost }}
- **Time Sustainability**: {{ top.state_properties.time_sustainability }}

</section>

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

## What is {{ top.name.replace(' (Attacks)', '').replace(' Top', '') }} from the Top?

{{ top.overview }}

</section>

<section id="state-invariants" class="content-section">

## What Defines This Position?

{% for invariant in top.state_invariants -%}
- {{ invariant }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="prerequisites" class="content-section">

## What Do You Need Before This Position?

{% for prereq in top.prerequisites -%}
- {{ prereq }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="key-principles" class="content-section">

## Key Offensive Principles

{% for principle in top.key_principles -%}
- {{ principle }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="offensive-transitions" class="content-section">

## What Attacks Are Available?

{% for transition in top.offensive_transitions -%}
### [[{{ transition.technique }}]] → [[{{ transition.target_position }}]]

**Success Rates:**
- Beginner: {{ transition.success_rates.beginner }}%
- Intermediate: {{ transition.success_rates.intermediate }}%
- Advanced: {{ transition.success_rates.advanced }}%

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="defensive-responses" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## How Does the Opponent Escape?

{% for response in top.defensive_responses -%}
- **[[{{ response.technique }}]]** → [[{{ response.target_position }}]]{% if response.success_rate %} (Opponent Success: {{ response.success_rate }}%){% endif %}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="counter-transitions" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## How to Counter Opponent's Escapes

{% for counter in top.counter_transitions -%}
- **[[{{ counter.technique }}]]** → [[{{ counter.target_position }}]]
  - {{ counter.trigger }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="decision-tree" class="content-section">

## Decision Making from This Position

{% for node in top.decision_tree -%}
**{{ node.condition }}:**
{% for action in node.actions -%}
- Execute **[[{{ action.technique }}]]** → [[{{ action.target }}]] (Probability: {{ action.probability }}%)
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="common-errors" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Common Offensive Mistakes

{% for error in top.common_errors -%}
### {{ loop.index }}. {{ error.error }}

- ❌ **Consequence**: {{ error.consequence }}
- ✅ **Correction**: {{ error.correction }}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="training-drills" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Training Drills for Attacks

{% for drill in top.training_drills -%}
### {{ drill.name }}

{{ drill.description }}

{% if drill.duration -%}
**Duration**: {{ drill.duration }}
{% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="optimal-submission-paths" class="content-section">

## Optimal Submission Paths

{% for path in top.optimal_submission_paths -%}
### {{ path.name }}

`{{ path.path }}`

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="position-metrics" class="content-section">

## Success Rates and Statistics

| Skill Level  | Retention Rate | Advancement Probability | Submission Probability |
|--------------|----------------|-------------------------|------------------------|
| Beginner     | {{ top.position_metrics.retention_rate.beginner }}% | {{ top.position_metrics.advancement_probability.beginner }}% | {{ top.position_metrics.submission_probability.beginner }}% |
| Intermediate | {{ top.position_metrics.retention_rate.intermediate }}% | {{ top.position_metrics.advancement_probability.intermediate }}% | {{ top.position_metrics.submission_probability.intermediate }}% |
| Advanced     | {{ top.position_metrics.retention_rate.advanced }}% | {{ top.position_metrics.advancement_probability.advanced }}% | {{ top.position_metrics.submission_probability.advanced }}% |

{% if top.position_metrics.average_time -%}
**Average Time in Position**: {{ top.position_metrics.average_time }}
{% endif %}

</section>

<section id="expert-insights" class="content-section expert-insight">

## What Do the Experts Say?

### John Danaher - Systematic Attacks

{{ top.expert_insights.danaher }}

### Gordon Ryan - Competition Application

{{ top.expert_insights.gordon_ryan }}

### Eddie Bravo - 10th Planet Approach

{{ top.expert_insights.eddie_bravo }}

</section>

<section id="related-content" class="content-section">

## Related Positions and Techniques

{% for item in top.related_content -%}
- **[[{{ item.name }}]]** - {{ item.relationship }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

</main>
